26:17.244 --> 26:21.914
The spines can grow up
to twenty centimeters long

26:21.915 --> 26:24.251
and they're covered in bacteria.

26:24.751 --> 26:29.798
Even the smallest cut could lead
to a fatal infection.

26:30.132 --> 26:31.758
